  "historyNote": "#7993, eff 11-26-03; ss by #9529, eff 8-17-09; ss by #10193, INTERIM, eff 10-1-12, EXPIRED: 4-1-13 New. #10329-B, eff 5-7-13; ss by #13757, eff 9-26-23",
